    "id": "sdshow01tab",
    "type": "tab",
    "label": "Speed Dial Showcase",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "Every place, style and feature of ui-speed-dial, on three pages: Home, Lights and Settings.\n\nDeploy, then open the Dashboard and pick one of these pages (/dashboard/speed-dial-home, -lights, -settings). If you already have a Dashboard, the pages are added to it. Each page explains what to try. Clicks are shown in the debug sidebar."
