    "height": 0,
    "content": "### Speed Dial showcase\n\n- **Bottom right:** the classic floating button. One of its actions uses an own image as icon.\n- **Header, next to the title:** the bell with a counter. Trigger *New alert (+1)* in the flow; the action *Clear counter* resets it. It is only shown on *Home* and *Lights*.\n- **Header, right:** the account menu in the *Menu list* style, on every page.\n\nClicks appear in the Node-RED debug sidebar.",
    "className": "",
    "x": 760,
    "y": 380,
    "wires": [
      []
    ]
